<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">iron-cleaver</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

A heavy butcher's cleaver for driving through joints, which brings bone and
fat off a carcass that a knife alone cannot.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       blacksmithing (minimum 5)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     forge
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> iron ingot (x2), wooden plank (x1)

